                       <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-[40px] items-center text-[13px] underline decoration-[var(--line)] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-3-3\" href=\"./product.html?product=2\">\n                            View product\n                        </a>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"product-item min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4\">\n                        <a class=\"product-photo relative block\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1\" href=\"./product.html?product=4\">\n                            <img alt=\"Contour Slip Dress\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"new arrival product image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566174053879-31528523f8ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=720&q=80\"/>\n                            <span class=\"absolute left-3 top-3 bg-[var(--paper)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"product label status\">\n                                New\n                            </span>\n                        </a>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-1\">\n                                <h3 class=\"product-name text-[14px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-1-1\">\n                                    Contour Slip Dress\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-1-2\">\n                                    Dresses\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"shrink-0 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-2-2\">\n                                Rs. 9,500\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <a class=\"inline-flex min-h-[40px] items-center text-[13px] underline decoration-[var(--line)] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2-4-3\" href=\"./product.html?product=4\">\n                            View product\n                        </a>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"story-heading\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-8 py-24 max-[760px]:px-5 max-[760px]:py-14\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" id=\"story\">\n            <div class=\"story-layout grid grid-cols-[.7fr_1.3fr] items-center gap-14 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\">\n                <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"brand-story-mark\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\">\n                    S\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"max-w-[720px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\">\n                    <h2 class=\"serif max-w-[15ch] text-[clamp(34px,4.2vw,56px)] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" id=\"story-heading\">\n                        Clothes that give you room to live.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\">\n                        We believe in fewer, better things. Honest fabrics, thoughtful cuts, and a slower approach to getting dressed.\n                    </p>\n                    <a class=\"mt-6 inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-3 text-[13px] underline decoration-[var(--line)] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3\" href=\"#story\">\n                        Our story\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-3-1\">\n                            ↗\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <footer class=\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\" data-kid=\"1-3\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-8 pb-7 pt-16 max-[760px]:px-5 max-[760px]:pt-12\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\">\n            <div class=\"footer-grid grid grid-cols-[1.15fr_.7fr_.8fr_1.25fr] gap-12 pb-16 max-[760px]:pb-10\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\">\n                    <a aria-label=\"Solids home\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1\" href=\"#home\">\n                        <img alt=\"Solids — No prints, just style\" class=\"block h-auto w-[180px] brightness-0 invert\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/solids-logo-transparent.png\"/>\n                    </a>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] text-white/65\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1-2\">\n                        Everyday, refined.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[13px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-1\">\n                        Explore\n                    </h2>\n                    <a class=\"mb-3 block text-[13px] text-white/70 hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-2\" href=\"./all.html\">\n                        Shop all\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"mb-3 block text-[13px] text-white/70 hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-3\" href=\"#arrivals\">\n                        New arrivals\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"block text-[13px] text-white/70 hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2-4\" href=\"#story\">\n                        Our story\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mb-4 text-[13px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-1\">\n                        Help\n                    </h2>\n                    <a class=\"mb-3 block text-[13px] text-white/70 hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-2\" href=\"mailto:solids@studio.pk?subject=Shipping%20and%20returns\">\n                        Shipping & returns\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"block text-[13px] text-white/70 hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3-3\" href=\"mailto:solids@studio.pk\">\n                        Contact the studio\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"newsletter-cell\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-[20px] font-normal\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-1\">\n                        The mailing list\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[330px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-white/65\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-2\">\n                        First look at new drops and quiet notes from the studio.\n                    </p>\n                    <form action=\"#\" aria-label=\"Join the Solids mailing list\" class=\"mt-5 flex min-h-[48px] max-w-[360px] border-b border-white/45\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-3\">\n                        <label class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-3-1\" for=\"newsletter-email\">\n                            Your email address\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent px-0 text-[14px] text-white placeholder:text-white/55 focus:outline-none\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-3-2\" id=\"newsletter-email\" placeholder=\"Your email address\" required=\"\" type=\"email\"/>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Subscribe to the mailing list\" class=\"min-w-[44px] text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-4-3-3\" data-name=\"mailing list subscribe button\" type=\"submit\">\n                            ↗\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-white/15 pt-5 text-[12px] text-white/55 max-[480px]:flex-col max-[480px]:items-start\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\">\n                    © 2026 Solids Official\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    Pakistan / PKR\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
